b9=$.c==="en"
c0=b9?"Trick 6: Last-layer shortcut":"Trick 6: \u0110\u01b0\u1eddng t\u1eaft t\u1ea7ng cu\u1ed1i"
c1=b9?"Once you have the yellow cross, use Sune \u2192 A-perm \u2192 U-perm instead of steps 5\u20137.":"C\xf3 d\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng v\xe0ng r\u1ed3i th\xec d\xf9ng Sune \u2192 A-perm \u2192 U-perm thay cho b\u01b0\u1edbc 5\u20137."
c2=b9?"Sune (yellow face): 1 yellow corner facing up \u2192 put it at front-left. 0 corners \u2192 turn U until the front-left corner has yellow on the LEFT side. 2 corners \u2192 the front-left corner has yellow facing FRONT. Do Sune and repeat until the yellow face is complete.":"Sune (l\xe0m m\u1eb7t v\xe0ng): 1 g\xf3c v\xe0ng h\u01b0\u1edbng l\xean \u2192 \u0111\u1eb7t n\xf3 \u1edf tr\u01b0\u1edbc-tr\xe1i. 0 g\xf3c \u2192 xoay U \u0111\u1ebfn khi g\xf3c tr\u01b0\u1edbc-tr\xe1i c\xf3 v\xe0ng \u1edf m\u1eb7t TR\xc1I. 2 g\xf3c \u2192 g\xf3c tr\u01b0\u1edbc-tr\xe1i c\xf3 v\xe0ng h\u01b0\u1edbng ra TR\u01af\u1edaC. L\xe0m Sune, l\u1eb7p \u0111\u1ebfn khi k\xedn m\u1eb7t v\xe0ng."
c3=b9?'A-perm (swap corners): look for "headlights" = 2 corners of the same colour on one side. Put the headlights at the back and do A-perm. No headlights: do it once from any angle, then look again. Done when all 4 sides have headlights.':'A-perm (\u0111\u1ed5i ch\u1ed7 g\xf3c): t\xecm "\u0111\xe8n pha" = 2 g\xf3c c\xf9ng m\xe0u tr\xean m\u1ed9t m\u1eb7t b\xean. \u0110\u1eb7t \u0111\xe8n pha \u1edf m\u1eb7t sau r\u1ed3i l\xe0m A-perm. Kh\xf4ng c\xf3 \u0111\xe8n pha: l\xe0m 1 l\u1ea7n \u1edf h\u01b0\u1edbng b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 r\u1ed3i t\xecm l\u1ea1i. Xong khi c\u1ea3 4 m\u1eb7t b\xean \u0111\u1ec1u c\xf3 \u0111\xe8n pha.'
c4=b9?"U-perm (swap edges): turn U so the corners match the centres. One side fully solved: put it at the back and do U-perm (do it once more if not done). No side solved: do it once from any angle, then check again.":"U-perm (\u0111\u1ed5i ch\u1ed7 c\u1ea1nh): xoay U cho g\xf3c kh\u1edbp t\xe2m. C\xf3 1 m\u1eb7t \u0111\xfang h\u1ebft: \u0111\u1eb7t m\u1eb7t \u0111\xf3 \u1edf sau, l\xe0m U-perm (ch\u01b0a xong th\xec l\xe0m th\xeam 1 l\u1ea7n). Kh\xf4ng c\xf3 m\u1eb7t n\xe0o \u0111\xfang: l\xe0m 1 l\u1ea7n \u1edf h\u01b0\u1edbng b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 r\u1ed3i xem l\u1ea1i."
c2=A.a([c2,c3,c4,b9?"Note: once you've done Sune, do NOT go back to the step 5\u20136 algorithms \u2013 they would scramble the yellow face again.":"L\u01b0u \xfd: \u0111\xe3 l\xe0m Sune th\xec KH\xd4NG quay l\u1ea1i c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c b\u01b0\u1edbc 5\u20136, v\xec ch\xfang l\xe0m x\xe1o l\u1ea1i m\u1eb7t v\xe0ng."],s)
b9=$.c==="en"
c3=b9?"Headlights at the back":"\u0110\xe8n pha \u1edf m\u1eb7t sau"
b9=b9?"Solved side at the back":"M\u1eb7t \u0111\xe3 \u0111\xfang \u1edf m\u1eb7t sau"
b9=A.a([B.Qw,new A.b_("aperm","A-perm","R' F R' B2 R F' R' B2 R2",c3),new A.b_("uperm","U-perm","R U' R U R U R U' R' U' R2",b9)],i6)
c3=$.c==="en"
c4=c3?"Turn with your fingers and never let go during an algorithm.":"Xoay b\u1eb1ng ng\xf3n tay, kh\xf4ng bu\xf4ng tay gi\u1eefa c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c."
c5=c3?"U: the right index flicks the top. U': the left index flicks. Other fingers stay off the top layer.":"U: ng\xf3n tr\u1ecf ph\u1ea3i g\u1ea1t m\u1eb7t tr\xean. U': ng\xf3n tr\u1ecf tr\xe1i g\u1ea1t. C\xe1c ng\xf3n kh\xe1c kh\xf4ng ch\u1ea1m t\u1ea7ng tr\xean."
c6=c3?"R and R': turn with the wrist, without regripping. D: the ring finger flicks the bottom.":"R v\xe0 R': xoay b\u1eb1ng c\u1ed5 tay, kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7m l\u1ea1i cube. D: ng\xf3n \xe1p \xfat g\u1ea1t m\u1eb7t d\u01b0\u1edbi."
c7=c3?"Thumbs on the front, other fingers on the back. Finish each algorithm with both thumbs on the front so you can start the next one immediately.":"Ng\xf3n c\xe1i \u1edf m\u1eb7t tr\u01b0\u1edbc, c\xe1c ng\xf3n kh\xe1c \u1edf m\u1eb7t sau. K\u1ebft th\xfac m\u1ed7i c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c v\u1edbi 2 ng\xf3n c\xe1i \u1edf m\u1eb7t tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 v\xe0o c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c sau ngay."
c8=c3?"Prefer algorithms with familiar \"triggers\" like R U R' U' (Sexy move) \u2013 they turn faster than short but awkward algorithms.":"\u01afu ti\xean c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c c\xf3 nhi\u1ec1u \"trigger\" quen tay nh\u01b0 R U R' U' (Tay Ph\u1ea3i) \u2014 xoay nhanh h\u01a1n c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c ng\u1eafn m\xe0 kh\xf3 c\u1ea7m."
c5=A.a([c5,c6,c7,c8,c3?"Exercise: repeat R U R' U' 20 times, time it in Algorithm mode, aim for 2 moves per second.":"B\xe0i t\u1eadp: l\u1eb7p R U R' U' 20 l\u1ea7n, b\u1ea5m gi\u1edd \u1edf ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 C\xf4ng th\u1ee9c, c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ea1t 2 b\u01b0\u1edbc/gi\xe2y."],s)
c3=A.a([new A.b_("sexy",$.c==="en"?h0:"Sexy move (Tay Ph\u1ea3i)",h1,""),B.QA],i6)
c6=$.c==="en"
c7=c6?"Trick 8: 15-second inspection":"Trick 8: Quan s\xe1t 15 gi\xe2y"
c8=c6?"Plan the cross before turning \u2013 exactly as WCA competition rules allow.":"L\xean k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch d\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi xoay \u2014 \u0111\xfang lu\u1eadt thi \u0111\u1ea5u WCA."
c9=c6?"Before each solve, spend up to 15 seconds just looking (turn on the \ud83d\udc41 icon in the Timer tab).":"Tr\u01b0\u1edbc m\u1ed7i l\u01b0\u1ee3t gi\u1ea3i, d\xe0nh t\u1ed1i \u0111a 15 gi\xe2y ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ec3 nh\xecn (b\u1eadt bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng \ud83d\udc41 \u1edf tab B\u1ea5m gi\u1edd)."
d0=c6?"Find the 4 white edges and plan the whole cross \u2013 see how pieces affect each other, not one at a time.":"T\xecm 4 c\u1ea1nh tr\u1eafng v\xe0 t\xednh tr\u01b0\u1edbc c\u1ea3 d\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng \u2014 nh\xecn c\xe1ch c\xe1c vi\xean \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng nhau, kh\xf4ng t\xednh t\u1eebng vi\xean."
d1=c6?"WCA rule: starting after 15 seconds is +2 seconds, over 17 seconds is a DNF. The app applies penalties and vibrates at 8 and 12 seconds.":"Lu\u1eadt WCA: b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u gi\u1ea3i sau 15 gi\xe2y b\u1ecb +2 gi\xe2y, qu\xe1 17 gi\xe2y l\xe0 DNF. App t\u1ef1 \xe1p ph\u1ea1t v\xe0 rung b\xe1o \u1edf gi\xe2y 8 v\xe0 12."
c9=A.a([c9,d0,d1,c6?"While solving: turn slowly but don't stop, with your eyes looking for the next piece (look-ahead).":"Khi gi\u1ea3i: xoay ch\u1eadm nh\u01b0ng kh\xf4ng d\u1eebng, m\u1eaft t\xecm m\u1ea3nh ti\u1ebfp theo (look-ahead)."],s)
c6=$.c==="en"
d0=c6?"Trick 9: Cross in 8 moves":"Trick 9: D\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng trong 8 b\u01b0\u1edbc"
d1=c6?"Every cross can be solved in 8 moves or fewer.":"M\u1ecdi d\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ec1u gi\u1ea3i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c trong 8 b\u01b0\u1edbc xoay tr\u1edf xu\u1ed1ng."
d2=c6?"According to J Perm, the cross can always be solved in \u2264 8 moves; usually about 6.":"Theo J Perm, d\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng lu\xf4n gi\u1ea3i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c trong \u2264 8 b\u01b0\u1edbc; th\u01b0\u1eddng kho\u1ea3ng 6 b\u01b0\u1edbc."
d3=c6?"Practice: for one scramble, find 2\u20133 different cross solutions and pick the shortest.":"T\u1eadp: v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t chu\u1ed7i x\xe1o, th\u1eed t\xecm 2\u20133 l\u1eddi gi\u1ea3i d\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng kh\xe1c nhau r\u1ed3i ch\u1ecdn c\xe1i ng\u1eafn nh\u1ea5t."
d4=c6?"Can't plan all 4 edges in 15 seconds yet? Practise with unlimited inspection first.":"Ch\u01b0a t\xednh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ea3 4 c\u1ea1nh trong 15 gi\xe2y? T\u1eadp v\u1edbi th\u1eddi gian quan s\xe1t kh\xf4ng gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n tr\u01b0\u1edbc."
d2=A.a([d2,d3,d4,c6?"Once comfortable: during inspection also find the first corner\u2013edge pair (Cross + 1) so you don't pause after the cross.":"Khi \u0111\xe3 quen: trong l\xfac quan s\xe1t t\xecm lu\xf4n c\u1eb7p g\xf3c\u2013c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u1ea7u ti\xean (Cross + 1) \u0111\u1ec3 kh\xf4ng kh\u1ef1ng sau d\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng."],s)
c6=$.c==="en"
d3=c6?"Trick 10: 3 levels of look-ahead":"Trick 10: Nh\xecn tr\u01b0\u1edbc 3 c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ed9"
d4=c6?"Solve smoothly without stopping to search for pieces (after CubeSkills).":"Gi\u1ea3i li\u1ec1n m\u1ea1ch, kh\xf4ng d\u1eebng \u0111\u1ec3 t\xecm m\u1ea3nh (theo CubeSkills)."
d5=c6?"Level 1 \u2013 Search: finish this pair/piece, then look for the next.":"C\u1ea5p 1 \u2013 T\xecm: l\xe0m xong c\u1eb7p/m\u1ea3nh n\xe0y r\u1ed3i m\u1edbi t\xecm m\u1ea3nh ti\u1ebfp theo."
d6=c6?"Level 2 \u2013 Track: follow the next piece with your eyes while solving this one.":"C\u1ea5p 2 \u2013 Theo d\xf5i: v\u1eeba gi\u1ea3i m\u1ea3nh n\xe0y v\u1eeba d\xf5i m\u1eaft theo m\u1ea3nh ti\u1ebfp theo."
d7=c6?"Level 3 \u2013 Predict: know where the next piece will be after you turn.":"C\u1ea5p 3 \u2013 Bi\u1ebft tr\u01b0\u1edbc: \u0111o\xe1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1ea3nh ti\u1ebfp theo s\u1ebd n\u1eb1m \u0111\xe2u sau khi xoay."
d8=c6?"Practise with a metronome: one turn per beat, gradually faster. Slow and steady beats fast and stuttering.":"T\u1eadp v\u1edbi m\xe1y \u0111\u1ebfm nh\u1ecbp: m\u1ed7i nh\u1ecbp m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n xoay, t\u0103ng t\u1ed1c d\u1ea7n. Ch\u1eadm m\xe0 \u0111\u1ec1u nhanh h\u01a1n nhanh m\xe0 kh\u1ef1ng."
d5=A.a([d5,d6,d7,d8,c6?"Visualisation: close your eyes, predict where a piece goes after R U R', then open your eyes and check.":"T\u1eadp h\xecnh dung: nh\u1eafm m\u1eaft, \u0111o\xe1n m\u1ed9t vi\xean s\u1ebd \u0111i \u0111\xe2u sau R U R', r\u1ed3i m\u1edf m\u1eaft ki\u1ec3m tra."],s)
c6=$.c==="en"
d6=c6?"F2L 1: Pair corner and edge":"F2L 1: Gh\xe9p c\u1eb7p g\xf3c\u2013c\u1ea1nh"
d7=c6?"Solve a white corner and a second-layer edge TOGETHER instead of in 2 separate steps.":"Gi\u1ea3i g\xf3c tr\u1eafng v\xe0 c\u1ea1nh t\u1ea7ng 2 C\xd9NG L\xdaC thay v\xec 2 b\u01b0\u1edbc ri\xeang."
d8=c6?'Idea: in the top layer, join a white corner with its matching edge into a "pair", then put the whole pair into its "slot".':'\xdd t\u01b0\u1edfng: \u1edf t\u1ea7ng tr\xean, gh\xe9p g\xf3c tr\u1eafng v\u1edbi c\u1ea1nh c\xf9ng m\xe0u th\xe0nh "c\u1eb7p", r\u1ed3i \u0111\u01b0a c\u1ea3 c\u1eb7p v\xe0o "khe" (slot) c\u1ee7a n\xf3.'
d9=c6?"Intuition first, algorithms later: hide the slot \u2192 make the pair \u2192 insert the pair. Never break slots you've finished.":"H\u1ecdc tr\u1ef1c gi\xe1c tr\u01b0\u1edbc, c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c sau: gi\u1ea5u khe \u2192 gh\xe9p c\u1eb7p \u2192 ch\xe8n c\u1eb7p. Kh\xf4ng bao gi\u1edd ph\xe1 c\xe1c khe \u0111\xe3 xong."
e0=c6?"Four lucky cases (pair already formed) need only 3\u20134 moves \u2013 see the algorithms below.":"B\u1ed1n tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p may m\u1eafn (c\u1eb7p \u0111\xe3 s\u1eb5n s\xe0ng) ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n 3\u20134 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u2014 xem c\xe1c c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c b\xean d\u01b0\u1edbi."
d8=A.a([d8,d9,e0,c6?"Use U to bring the pair to its slot and avoid rotating the whole cube.":"D\xf9ng U \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0a c\u1eb7p t\u1edbi khe, h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf xoay c\u1ea3 cube."],s)
