d9=$.c==="en"
e0=d9?"F2L 2: White corner facing up":"F2L 2: G\xf3c tr\u1eafng h\u01b0\u1edbng l\xean"
e1=d9?"The corner's white sticker faces up, the edge is in the top layer.":"G\xf3c c\xf3 m\xe0u tr\u1eafng nh\xecn l\xean tr\xean, c\u1ea1nh \u1edf t\u1ea7ng tr\xean."
e2=d9?"Don't use one algorithm for everything: separate the corner and edge, then pair them up.":"Kh\xf4ng d\xf9ng m\u1ed9t c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c cho m\u1ecdi tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p: t\xe1ch g\xf3c v\xe0 c\u1ea1nh ra r\u1ed3i gh\xe9p l\u1ea1i."
e2=A.a([e2,d9?"Watch the 3D cube for each algorithm to see the pair being split \u2013 joined \u2013 inserted.":"Xem cube 3D \u1edf m\u1ed7i c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1ea5y c\u1eb7p \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\xe1ch \u2013 gh\xe9p \u2013 ch\xe8n th\u1ebf n\xe0o."],s)
