d=g?"Switching hands keeps the same R and U algorithms \u2013 only the grip changes: redo the grip from One-handed 1 with the other hand, like a mirror image.":"\u0110\u1ed5i tay v\u1eabn d\xf9ng \u0111\xfang c\xe1c c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c R v\xe0 U \u0111\xe3 h\u1ecdc \u2013 ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ed5i c\xe1ch c\u1ea7m: l\xe0m l\u1ea1i t\u01b0 th\u1ebf \u1edf b\xe0i M\u1ed9t tay 1 b\u1eb1ng tay kia, nh\u01b0 soi g\u01b0\u01a1ng."
c=g?"Start the weaker hand on short algorithms (R U R' U', Sune) at a slow tempo in the fingertrick metronome; only speed up once it's clean.":"Tay y\u1ebfu b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u b\u1eb1ng c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c ng\u1eafn (R U R' U', Sune) theo nh\u1ecbp ch\u1eadm \u1edf \"Luy\u1ec7n ng\xf3n theo nh\u1ecbp\", t\u1edbi khi kh\xf4ng v\u1ea5p m\u1edbi t\u0103ng nh\u1ecbp."
b=g?"Each session, train the weaker hand first while it's fresh. Or alternate: left hand on even days, right hand on odd days.":"M\u1ed7i bu\u1ed5i t\u1eadp tay y\u1ebfu tr\u01b0\u1edbc, l\xfac tay c\xf2n t\u1ec9nh. Ho\u1eb7c xen k\u1ebd: ng\xe0y ch\u1eb5n tay tr\xe1i, ng\xe0y l\u1ebb tay ph\u1ea3i."
a=g?"On the Timer (One-handed mode), pick the hand before solving: the app tracks each hand and shows the slower one in Progress.":"Tr\xean m\xe0n B\u1ea5m gi\u1edd (ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 M\u1ed9t tay), ch\u1ecdn \u0111\xfang tay tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi gi\u1ea3i: app th\u1ed1ng k\xea ri\xeang t\u1eebng tay v\xe0 ch\u1ec9 ra tay ch\u1eadm h\u01a1n trong Ti\u1ebfn b\u1ed9."
